  "about": "What a fresh Tares 1.61.0 cell holds, read from a real 1.61.0 install (PyPI tares==1.61.0) on 2026-11-28 for the one-time 1.x to 2.0 migration script (TR-1821). The session store's Alembic version table is session_store_version. A local cell keeps the session store in tares.sqlite and the rest in tares.duckdb beside it. A cell with TARES_STATE_DSN keeps the session store and the moved state tables in Postgres, and still opens tares.duckdb for the event tables (its copies of the moved state tables stay there as they were at the move).",
